OL,3,GNEWSAE-bike rail ban will limit my
OL,4,Afamily's freedom, says mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA single mother from Liverpool has said
OL,7,Fthat a ban on certain types of e-bike
OL,8,Fon the city's Merseyrail trains will
OL,9,F"severely curtail" her family's
OL,10,Ffreedom.
OL,12,FNon-folding e-bikes will be banned from
OL,13,Fthe services and stations from January
OL,14,Fdue to safety concerns about battery
OL,15,Ffires.
OL,17,FThe company said the ban was a decision
OL,18,F"it had not taken lightly" and "our
OL,19,Foverriding responsibility is to provide
OL,20,Fa safe environment for our staff and
OL,21,Four passengers".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
